@@ -1662,9 +1664,9 @@
             <div class="summary-row"><div><h3>Services</h3><p class="small">ADA Services and Other Services, organized in two parts, and neither outranks the other. Start in the part that matches the problem in front of you.</p></div><a href="#services" class="quiet-link" data-go="services">Explore Services</a></div>
             <div class="summary-row"><div><h3>Voting, speaking, and coordinator support</h3><p class="small">Voting and polling places, keynote speaking ($2,500 in person, $1,500 virtual), and coordinator support for entities that must designate the role.</p></div><span class="summary-links"><a href="#voting" class="quiet-link" data-go="voting">Voting</a> <a href="#speaking" class="quiet-link" data-go="speaking">Speaking</a> <a href="#selfeval" class="quiet-link" data-go="selfeval">Coordinator support</a></span></div>
